Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:38.00,Rin_VN,Rin,0,0,0,,Yay! Is everyone having a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:48.73,Luka_VN,Luka,0,0,0,,Good. It looks like they're enjoying themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:55.50,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,Yeah! But... I've started to want to hear\Neveryone's voices even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:01:01.75,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,Next, let's all try doing it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:10.25,Luka_VN,Luka,0,0,0,,Oh, that sounds like fun. Well then,\Nlet's all try saying "Yay!" together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:12.90,Luka_VN,Luka,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,750)}Ready, set...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:27.25,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,Thank you! I'm so happy you came to see us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:36.50,Luka_VN,Luka,0,0,0,,It's so reassuring to know that everyone here\Nis always watching over those kids with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:42.25,Rin_VN,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, hey! Since we're here,\Nwhy don't we all go see how they're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:46.00,Rin_VN,Rin,0,0,0,,It sounds like they're doing something interesting today!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:51.75,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,That sounds like a good idea.\NIt seems LEN and the others went yesterday, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:55.75,Luka_VN,Luka,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:59.33,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,Well then... here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:08.76,An,An,0,0,0,,Phew...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:10.64,An,An,0,0,0,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:12.28,An,An,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:16.03,An,An,0,0,0,,That music parade through the city was so much fun, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.20,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:22.97,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Thanks to the theme of "giving thanks through music," I really felt motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:26.68,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Your group's opening was really great too, Hoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:28.37,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,I could really feel your emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.37,0:02:29.13,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.68,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:34.44,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to hear you say that, Kanade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:37.60,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,The confetti shower during the chorus was nice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:40.60,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Who came up with that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:42.40,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,That was Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:45.13,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,It sounds like she got the idea from Tsukasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:46.28,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:48.60,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,So that's why Tsukasa-san... Tsukasa-kun, the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.48,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,628)}Hehehehe...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:50.48,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,284)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:56.51,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,...the other day, he was ca-carrying around the st-stock of confetti I keep at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:56.51,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(160,160)}Rui?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:58.67,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(322,174)}Come on, Rui.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:02.08,An,An,0,0,0,,You seem a bit off, Kamishiro-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.71,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Maybe you're just too fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:08.28,An,An,0,0,0,,I had no idea you kept confetti on hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:09.52,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:12.52,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Confetti is essential for a show, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:17.53,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,On the other hand, Shiraishi's group captivated us with just their singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:19.94,An,An,0,0,0,,Well, we do compete with our singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:23.64,An,An,0,0,0,,Akito and the others seemed especially fired up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:24.88,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:27.00,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,The singing was really electrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:29.68,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,He went home right away today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.98,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,but I wanted to hear a bit more from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:32.87,An,An,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:37.83,An,An,0,0,0,,He said something to Toya about going to a shop nearby that has great cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.63,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,But it really was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:46.81,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,The audience all raised their arms at once, it was almost hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:47.51,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:49.74,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Were you okay, Kanade?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:53.73,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,You mentioned before that you aren't very good with crowds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:54.40,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:04:00.53,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,I'm a little... well, a lot tired, but the singing was so good that I didn't mind it that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:01.03,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:02.88,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.11,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:08.62,An,An,0,0,0,,But Kamishiro-senpai and his group stole the biggest hype of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.24,An,An,0,0,0,,so I'm a little frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:14.11,An,An,0,0,0,,Right when I heard the "bang!" from the streamers shooting out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:16.24,An,An,0,0,0,,you all just appeared in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.36,An,An,0,0,0,,That's just not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:26.07,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Honami told me you'd appear from the sky, but I never expected a magic trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.07,0:04:26.57,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:29.36,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:33.32,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,We didn't actually appear out of thin air, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:38.96,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,We suspended everyone at the top of the float, then lowered down all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:44.80,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,At the same time, we fired streamers with gas-powered cannons,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.76,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,making it look as if we suddenly dropped out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:48.46,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:51.36,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,It really is like magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:54.16,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Being suspended up there was a bit scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:57.90,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,But seeing the audience's reaction made it all worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:58.76,An,An,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:03.56,An,An,0,0,0,,You look so quiet, Kusanagi, but you've actually got a lot of guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:04.65,An,An,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.65,0:05:05.15,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:07.47,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.20,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Ah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:10.49,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:14.07,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,speaking of which, Hanasato and her group were amazing too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:14.57,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:17.10,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,It's called a call-and-response, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:20.84,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,They really got the crowd pumped up with that. It was so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:21.60,An,An,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:23.00,An,An,0,0,0,,They really were...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:25.36,An,An,0,0,0,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.92,An,An,0,0,0,,Where did Haruka and the others go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:28.01,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:30.99,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Looks like Mizuki also ran off somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:35.40,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:36.73,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I heard Rui flubbed his line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:40.52,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,So this is where you all were.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:42.23,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,You certainly have sharp ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:45.34,An,An,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Mizuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.34,0:05:46.84,An,An,0,0,0,,And Airi, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:48.25,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,He did flub quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:48.92,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:50.44,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Where were you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:51.20,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Kanade...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:55.12,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Oh, we were actually holding a mini handshake event until just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:56.29,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,A mini handshake event?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:57.13,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:06:02.96,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,MMJ asked the staff if they could hold an event where they could meet their fans face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:05.86,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,They sure know what the fans want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:06.62,An,An,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:08.84,An,An,0,0,0,,Man, I wish I could've gone to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:11.68,An,Ichika,0,0,0,,I would've lined up for Haruka just to tease her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:14.08,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I'd love to see how she'd react to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:18.36,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,But this time, Minori was the one who was really popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.39,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:20.52,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:22.52,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:24.25,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,So what happened was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:35.48,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for your support!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:37.15,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,I'll keep doing my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:43.60,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,I'm so glad more people came\Nto the mini handshake event than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.47,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Next person, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:47.16,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:51.52,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Did your whole family come to cheer us on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.04,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Wow, that makes me so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:55.00,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:57.51,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Ehe! How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:06:59.53,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Three years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:02.07,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Ehehe, you're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:04.88,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Well then, let's shake hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:06.48,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:08.43,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,You want to hold hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:10.04,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:12.45,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Let's hold hands and swing them around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.28,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:16.59,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Now you want a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:22.00,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,You're a... a little heavy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.74,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,I'm glad it made you happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:26.87,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:29.56,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:35.06,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,All the other little kids waiting in line\Nare asking for hugs now too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.48,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,W-what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:42.96,Minori_VN,Minori,0,0,0,,This isn't a handshake event anymore,\Nit's a hugging event!
Comment: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:42.96,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,At this point insert the "scream if you love minori gif"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:55.04,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,And just like that, she was a total hit with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.59,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,That sounds just like Minori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:08:01.51,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Just picturing that is so cute, it makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:06.70,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so proud that my little Minori is so popular with the little ones too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:08.27,An,An,0,0,0,,Hands off her, Mizuki, she's not just yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:11.33,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Mizuki really can be like that, can't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:12.06,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:16.54,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,As a fan, don't you just want to say, 'I raised that girl!'
Comment: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:16.36,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Please Insert "I raised that boy meme" https://i.kym-cdn.com/photos/images/newsfeed/001/458/742/dd3.png with minori image overlaid
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:23.84,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,But seeing that makes me want to be cheered on by little kids and do some fan service too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.12,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Wait, you too, Mizuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:26.04,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:29.75,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I mean, given the nature of our group's activities...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:29.75,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an4}{\pos(160,160)}Fan service?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:33.96,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Well, our activities...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.52,0:08:33.96,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an4}{\pos(160,160)}Did I hear you say fan service?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:36.64,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Ah, well, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:36.64,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(160,160)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:37.80,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Crap, crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:42.92,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm indeed curious to see what kind of fan service you would do, Mizuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:50.96,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:55.84,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm a big fan of your videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:59.32,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\an4}{\pos(160,160)}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:08:59.32,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I—I really love "Heat Abnormal".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:02.05,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I really love "Bake no Ka" too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:03.48,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Sorry, I meant, "Bake no Hana".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.98,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I really love "Bake no Hana".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.39,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,This guy sure talks a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.39,0:09:07.28,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:09.36,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I don't really mind these kinds of troublesome fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:13.14,An,An,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:15.00,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.75,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Since you started it, I think you should go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:22.15,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Look, Rui, even Kanade is telling you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:22.84,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:24.78,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Don't I make an adorable child?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:28.28,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Not cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.49,0:09:29.72,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}I'm simply making\Nmy friend's wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:31.13,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:33.46,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Mizuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:37.19,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Please shake\Nmy hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:39.20,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:40.60,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:42.08,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Here, let's\Nshake hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:46.72,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}By the way, can you\Ndo a cool voice too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:48.88,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}A...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.25,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}A cool voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:51.00,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:55.68,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}I'd love to hear\NRui's cool voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:57.86,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:01.19,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Let's practice some\Nfan service, Rui.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:03.04,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:04.79,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:07.17,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}A—Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:11.80,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Are you\Na fan of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:14.39,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:17.96,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Which show did you\Nlike the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:20.21,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:22.28,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}you must come\Nsee me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:25.84,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I want to see it, I want to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:31.19,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,How was our fanservice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:33.73,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Did it feel... weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:34.48,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.28,0:10:37.67,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:40.15,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,it didn't feel weird at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:42.18,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\an4}{\pos(160,160)}It didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:42.18,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:48.32,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,I think the weird part was how into it Rui was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:51.44,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,B-But Mizuki, you were actually pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:54.34,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Honestly, you could become an idol right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:55.04,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:57.32,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Even for sweet-talk, that's pushing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.36,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I'm no match for the pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.83,An,An,0,0,0,,Mizuki really does respect idols, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:06.84,An,An,0,0,0,,Actually, fan service for kids sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:08.96,An,An,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll give it a shot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:12.87,An,An,0,0,0,,Kusanagi, do you want to do it with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.57,0:11:12.09,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1687,238)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:14.09,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:15.52,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,M-Me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.52,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,I—I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.08,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Nene and An together, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:21.61,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Hey, Rui...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.56,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,You're both such great singers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:27.77,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Isn't this our line?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.77,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,How about something hip-hop?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.28,0:11:30.37,An,An,0,0,0,,Hip-hop?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:31.65,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:34.44,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:34.44,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Shiraishi...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:35.28,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:35.88,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.40,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Would you like a beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.39,0:11:42.52,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:44.72,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,An, you can say no, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:47.56,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}I don't know why, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.61,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}I feel like I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:52.88,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Alright, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:55.33,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Could y'all go\Na little faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:07.33,Virtual Singers,An,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Lyrics from "Fire Dance"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.54,An,An,0,0,0,,{\i1}kurabete shimau no dokudoku{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:02.48,An,An,0,0,0,,{\i1}me no mae yume no kabe dake knock knock{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:04.12,An,An,0,0,0,,{\i1}taisou na risou sore de kekkou{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:07.33,An,An,0,0,0,,{\i1}ato wa hitasura mae ni susumu dake, yeah{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:08.51,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:10.04,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}That was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:13.16,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Hey, so I think\Nthat's plenty, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.95,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'd love to hear Nene's too, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:21.00,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}I wonder if\NI can do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:24.60,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Ah, well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.71,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}I'll give it\Nmy best shot...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:26.79,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:29.93,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:31.29,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:31.79,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:33.52,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:35.46,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}We are Wandasho.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.87,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:41.81,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}All smiles, ruling the show,\Nsamurai spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.81,0:12:43.84,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Hopes we pursue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:45.80,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Dreams we\Nmake come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.52,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Bring everyone along,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:49.14,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}it's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:50.96,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:50.96,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:52.50,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:54.79,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}That was\Nawesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.65,0:12:54.79,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:55.88,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}I've always...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:58.71,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}heard Shinonome\Ngrooving to the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:02.95,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}That explains it!\NThat was so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.95,0:13:03.90,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}That was so\Nembarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:05.48,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Thanks for playing along!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:06.53,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}I'm glad we did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:08.44,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}That deserves\Na fist bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:09.56,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}A... fist bump?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:11.05,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}L-Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:12.48,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:14.12,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Let's keep\Nrocking together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:15.71,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:21.24,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Woah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:23.00,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,That was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:25.31,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Kusanagi is really good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:28.23,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,She's got the soul of a rapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:28.99,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:29.49,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:33.76,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I believe I have that same sense of rhythm, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:34.47,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.28,0:13:37.20,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Does that mean you want a turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:38.51,An,An,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:41.64,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:45.41,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,We're behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.41,0:13:46.65,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:46.65,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:47.53,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:50.04,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,You seemed right at home doing that, An.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.26,An,An,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.72,An,An,0,0,0,,I talk to the little kids around town quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:55.75,An,An,0,0,0,,So, next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:58.86,An,An,0,0,0,,Hoshino, want to give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:13:58.86,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:00.72,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Are we just going down the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:02.76,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,We really don't have to do this just to fill time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:05.16,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,But the script says 'I don't want to, but fine,' so okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:06.12,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,S-So you're doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:07.68,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Nice, nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:09.22,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Let's keep going down the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.80,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I have a recommendation for who should play the kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:13.05,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,it's our very own Kanade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:14.92,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:16.96,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Good luck, Kanade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:17.80,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(160,160)}Are—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.05,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Everyone's counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:19.05,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(160,160)}Are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:19.88,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.23,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Are you really sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:23.32,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.59,0:14:25.92,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Big sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:26.72,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Oh...
Comment: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:26.23,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Maybe replace with pog face or ichika surprised stamp
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:28.64,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Big sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.42,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,What an unexpected side of Kanade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:32.20,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(1741.818,270)}Urgh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:35.81,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Big sister's performance\Nwas so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.83,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}I'll keep\Ncheewing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:42.46,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:44.99,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}I never thought I'd hear\Nsomething so sweet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.99,0:14:46.08,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}If you'd like,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:49.27,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,{\pos(479,944)}I'd love it if you listened\Nwith your friends too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:49.82,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:50.64,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:53.88,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,{\pos(1437,944)}Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:58.01,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,You did great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:14:59.96,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,That was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:14:59.96,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,That was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:02.75,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Everyone's showing a whole new side of themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:04.58,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,As expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:06.19,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,That felt so professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:09.08,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:10.55,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,But then again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:15.72,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I guess she didn't sound that childish, but it felt so professional it made my heart race!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:17.48,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,It was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:17.48,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,It was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.04,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,You all did an amazing job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:20.96,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Now then, finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:25.29,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,as a reward for everyone's hard work,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:29.38,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I'll deliver some praise-filled fan service!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:32.00,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Praise-filled fan service?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:32.00,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Praise-filled fan service?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:32.88,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.88,0:15:35.80,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Sounds like a huge treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:39.28,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I mean, everyone was great, so now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:40.49,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,{\pos(1495,244)}Now, now, now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:41.33,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Wait? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.28,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:44.50,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Since we have this wonderful stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:45.20,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.80,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,It would be a waste not to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.45,0:15:49.48,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(234,224)}Ah~!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:50.68,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Wh-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:51.20,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:53.20,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Please take the microphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:54.12,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,OI!!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.61,0:15:58.55,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm sure the cameraman can follow along.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.60,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I-I don't know what you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:03.88,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I stood up thinking it was my turn, Rui.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:06.25,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Everyone, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:07.29,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:08.60,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.77,0:16:08.60,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:12.15,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Now that you're on your feet, how about a sea of pink for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.15,0:16:13.56,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,E—Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:16.83,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,It's not even my birthday or anything, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:18.28,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:20.52,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Where's the camera? Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.53,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,That one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:23.06,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:30.44,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Everyone, you did a wonderful job singing, dancing, and practicing your fan service today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:36.24,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,For being such good kids, Airi-chan is going to hit you with a Happy Good Kids Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.41,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Prepare for the wave, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:43.64,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:46.37,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Mmmmmm, all charged up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:47.40,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:17:00.49,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Happy Good Kids Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:06.20,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:09.94,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I FEEL REBORN!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:11.72,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,That was incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:13.44,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,H-How was that, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:17.20,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Did it reach all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:20.47,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Though I feel like I received some incredible fan service at the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:20.47,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,{\pos(284,274)}Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:22.12,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,You'd better treasure this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:23.44,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,She looked like she wanted to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.52,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Of course it reached everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.32,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Then I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:32.32,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Well then, see you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:33.52,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.52,0:17:35.38,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I'll always be watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.07,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,So, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:39.88,Virtual Singers,Virtual Singers,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs55\i1}She's emphasizing that was all an adlib.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:41.91,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,A big round of applause!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:41.91,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Now that's a real idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:43.59,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.59,0:17:44.68,An,An,0,0,0,,That was the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:46.71,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Don't make me run right before the concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:50.80,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Being praised that much makes me a little embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:56.56,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,But I practice my fan service every day for everyone who supports us, so I'm really happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:58.36,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:03.28,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I'll polish my fan service and ad-lib skills too, so I can respond anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:04.72,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Wait, Mizuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:07.35,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Aren't you always good at ad-libbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.28,0:18:11.27,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Though... will you even have the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.84,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Maybe I should practice a bit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:18.35,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,It's a great way to say thank you to all those supporting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:19.06,An,An,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:23.88,An,An,0,0,0,,We want to make sure our feelings reach everyone, through both words and music.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:29.00,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,After doing the parade, I want to reach even more people too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.32,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:34.20,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's keep delivering our feelings to as many people as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:54.00,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,Hehe. It sounds like it was a very lively parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:59.50,Luka_VN,Luka,0,0,0,,That must be why MIKU and the others\Ninvited us to hold a parade yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:07.50,Rin_VN,Rin,0,0,0,,Let's do our best to deliver\Ntons and tons of gratitude too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:12.63,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, RIN,\Nhaven't you already started practicing with LEN?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:18.75,Rin_VN,Rin,0,0,0,,Yep! We're going to do a robot dance\Nwhile singing and playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:23.36,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,J-just how much are you packing into your performance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.36,0:19:29.00,Luka_VN,Luka,0,0,0,,But it sounds like it'll be\Na really fun and energetic performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:36.75,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,That's true. I'll have to do my best too,\Nso I don't lose to RIN and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:43.25,KAITO_VN,KAITO,0,0,0,,Well then, everyone. Thank you for coming today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:49.89,Luka_VN,Luka,0,0,0,,We hope you'll continue to receive plenty\Nof our gratitude after this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:53.00,Rin_VN,Rin,0,0,0,,See you! Bye-bye!
